### Canvas: assignments for D0031N
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser/D0031N/uppgifter
Accept: application/json

### Lowercase course code also works
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser/d0031n/uppgifter
Accept: application/json

### Unknown course gives an empty list
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser/X9999X/uppgifter
Accept: application/json